From: Wine upstream contributors (see commit list)
Subject: [PATCH] Backport targeted Wine 11.22 fixes.

Squashed backport of 47 WineHQ commits: 46 first released in
wine-11.22, and 673e09be71, on master after wine-11.22 and not yet
released. Applied in upstream order on top of
cx26.3-wine11.0-runeon.38 patches 0001-0186. Test-only hunks are
omitted. c209164daf fixes a regression of 6b486ec783 (carried since
.27) and ede017e2b2 fixes a regression of d56f36c1aa (carried in 0145).
ede017e2b2 (winemac.drv) is carried under the macOS fix exception;
673e09be71 (ntdll) and df33af7a82 (win32u) under the Windows-behaviour
exception for ntdll, win32u and server; 6fd2ef6b19 and 3d15b75cfa
(server), 83fddb06f5 (win32u) and d7f7d8031a (wow64win) with the
maintainer's individual approval.
Runeon adaptations, marked [adapted] below, fix memory errors the
upstream commits introduce and upstream master (433ffc868d) still has:
55e672f517 grows the value arrays to at least one entry, because
doubling a count of 0 made realloc() free the array that the cleanup
then freed again; 53bac7c5f3 reports the unexpected type id before
freeing the type record instead of reading it after the free.

  f6a397054c Vitaly Lipatov: gdiplus: Fix the point count handling in GdipGetPathData().
  228557e936 Vitaly Lipatov: gdiplus: Add missing NULL checks.
  6fd2ef6b19 Nikolay Sivov: server/class: Fix missing object release on failure path.
