  53a0cdd776 Eric Pouech: dbghelp: Fix some memory leaks.
  53bac7c5f3 Eric Pouech: dbghelp: Fix a couple of missing memory releases on error path. [adapted]
  f4eea401e4 Eric Pouech: dbghelp: Handle NULL Mask in SymEnumSourceFilesW.
  9695343d71 Hans Leidekker: winhttp: Consistently use src_len in str_to_wire().
  a5ea938598 Hans Leidekker: winhttp: Allow 'read' to be NULL in stream_Read().
