  3d15b75cfa Alexandre Julliard: server: Don't return an error when thread_get_inflight_fd() succeeds.
  1170e76ca5 Vitaly Lipatov: crypt32: Don't close the certificate file twice.
  2d2dc3db07 James Hawkins: cabinet: Return FDIERROR_TARGET_FILE when writing extracted data fails.
  845b5ddcba Hans Leidekker: wbemprox: Validate len in fill_rawbiosdata().
  b250fc643d Hans Leidekker: wbemprox: Handle optional fields in fill_printer().
  2d863f2774 Hans Leidekker: wbemprox: Handle NULL resource in parse_resource().
  dcd891037d Hans Leidekker: wbemprox: Fix row index in fill_printer().
  ec7a423eff Hans Leidekker: wbemprox: Avoid assigning uninitialized process ID in process_create().
  55e672f517 Hans Leidekker: wbemprox: Increase buffer size if necessary in enum_values(). [adapted]
  783a8f8fe3 Hans Leidekker: wbemprox: Handle NULL out parameter in process_create().
  9ead75872d Nikolay Sivov: d3dx9: Avoid file data name use-after-free on failure path.
  f436af4047 Nikolay Sivov: mfplat/buffer: Do not leave uninitialized buffer on d3d9 LockRect() failure.
  bfb465e290 Nikolay Sivov: mfplat/buffer: Do not leave uninitialized buffer on DXGI surface mapping failure.
  26b318f826 Nikolay Sivov: mfplat: Fix new collection size in InsertElementAt().
  662ebcb03b Nikolay Sivov: d2d1: Fix potential leak on error path.
  7fccdf7e1c Nikolay Sivov: d2d1: Fix potential factory reference leak on failure path.
  ee607cf42b Nikolay Sivov: d2d1/effect: Fix potential leak of failure path in CreateVertexBuffer().
  c209164daf Paul Gofman: ddraw: Do not force render target for surface formats which do not support it.
  8f4826ad8c Alistair Leslie-Hughes: quartz: Allow IObjectWithSite::SetSite(NULL).
  4bd7fd80be Andrey Gusev: mscoree: Check for NULL This in DllGetClassObject().
  62621e50ba Vishnunithyasoundhar S: msvcrt/scanf: Fix crash in fscanf due to null dereferencing a file.
  c7e26cf11d Brendan McGrath: amstream: Fix segfault when 'ipin' is NULL.
  8b4cf949c8 Brendan McGrath: amstream: Handle an uninitialised stream in IAMMultiMediaStream::Render.
  7384c8babc Alex Henrie: kernelbase: Don't go past null in StrCmpN* or StrIsIntlEqual*.
  f9022cf74b Paul Gofman: windows.gaming.input: Reset index before enumeration in initialize_providers().
  d7f7d8031a Alexandre Julliard: wow64win: Fix return device mapping in wow64_NtUserGetRawInputDeviceList().
  83fddb06f5 Alexandre Julliard: win32u: Specify zero bits when mapping a DIB section.
  ede017e2b2 Zhiyi Zhang: winemac.drv: Set window foreground when doing unminimization.
  412a292464 James Hawkins: wininet: Clean up on failure when initializing cache index.
  df33af7a82 Rémi Bernon: win32u: Always write to NtUserToUnicodeEx output buffer.
  673e09be71 Alexandre Julliard: ntdll: Ignore files that don't have a name in get_unix_full_path().

